WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.800
This is our new orphanage?

00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:18.440
It's as big as a castle!

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.200
Feel free to use the house as you see fit.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.300
Misses Mullins and I will stay down here.

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.040
Your rooms are upstairs.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.460
Locked...

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.800
and it stays that way.

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:48.140
(you are my sunshine, my only sunshine, you make me happy when... )

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:52.960
You're the monster, are you?

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.520
Can you help me?

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:00.720
Ahhh!!!

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:08.980
Janice says she's seen your daughter

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.440
My daughter has been dead for a very long time.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.560
She was taken from us at an early age.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:17.540
Nooooo!!!

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:22.520
We prayed to see our beloved girl again.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:25.560
The contact started small,

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:30.400
but then it wanted permission to move into a doll,

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.440
so it can be with us forever.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.060
We said yes.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:51.260
Ahhh!!!!

00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.620
Sister. It's coming after me.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:01:57.660
Ahhh!!!!

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.660
Who? An evil presence.

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:07.260
It's because I'm the weakest.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:09.620
It's the doll.

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:11.540
The devil.

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.140
Annabelle!?

